/P 53 0 R
/E (The programme focused on developing critical managerial skills, strategic thinking, effective decision-making, leadership, team management, communication, and organisational effectiveness. Particular emphasis was placed on strengthening competencies required to navigate the evolving business environment of the power sector, manage organisational change, and improve managerial effectiveness. )
