/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (Through a blend of interactive classroom sessions, case-based discussions, experiential learning activities, and practical managerial exercises, participants were encouraged to relate contemporary management concepts and frameworks to their organisational roles and workplace challenges. The programme also provided a platform for peer learning and experience sharing, enabling participants to exchange insights and perspectives on emerging managerial challenges.)
